### ===================================
### Export API Tests
### Base Path: /rangi_windows/api/export
### ===================================

### Export to Excel - All Projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/export/excel

###

### Export to Excel - Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/export/excel?start=2024-01-01&end=2024-12-31

###

### Export to Excel - Archived Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/export/excel?archived=true

###

### Export to Excel - With All Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/export/excel?start=2024-01-01&end=2024-12-31&archived=false

###

### Export to PDF - All Projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/export/pdf

###

### Export to PDF - Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/export/pdf?start=2024-01-01&end=2024-12-31

###

### Export to PDF - Archived Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/export/pdf?archived=true

###

### Export to PDF - With All Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/rangi_windows/api/export/pdf?start=2024-01-01&end=2024-12-31&archived=false
